PhaseShift ps patch 0014-cache-ordering (2026-11-10). SimX CacheBank same-sector ordering fix (docs/vortex_errata.md
item 38; methodology §18.6). Stock defect: MSHR::dequeue() frees a replay's entry when the replay enters the bank pipe, so a
Core request ahead of it in the pipe performs first (WAR/WAW/RAW), and the fill-forward drain can answer a read ahead of an
older in-pipe write. Fix: replay-entry gate + forward gate (conflict = same sector, >= 1 store/atomic, store/store only on
overlapping bytes); env-gated read-only order checker PS_ORDER_CHECK=1. The base tree carries the identical code
(patches/vortex/base/0014-cache-ordering.patch).

